DESCRIPTION:Curious about your family roots? The Family Heritage Experienc
 e at American Ancestors offers an interactive journey designed to spark re
 flection about your family's history and identity. Through a blend of hand
 s-on activities and multimedia elements\, you will be encouraged to explor
 e the questions you have about where you come from and what you might want
  to uncover next. No genealogy experience is required to enjoy this immers
 ive exhibition\; it is a welcoming space with knowledgeable staff to help 
 anyone beginning to ask questions about their past or looking to engage wi
 th family history in a new way. Open Tuesday through Saturday from 10:00 A
 M to 6:00 PM.\n\nSources: Meet Boston\nEvent page: https://www.meetboston.
 com/event/the-family-heritage-experience/85553/
