DTEND:20250916T020000
DTSTAMP:20261004T161355Z
UID:f1753e40d673590f1bd4e57a4fad43@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Have fun and unleash your inner art and food critic while expl
 oring Central Square\, Cambridge with us. Discover a hidden art passageway
  – this tour is full of cool surprises! Home to a vibrant public art sce
 ne\, including iconic Graffiti Alley\, a sanctioned graffiti walkway that 
 changes daily\, and a variety of impressive large scale murals commissione
 d by the city from award-winning local talent. Uncover the artists and mea
 ning behind these dynamic murals and enjoy delicious\, diverse eats from l
 ocal independent establishments including a classy Italian neighborhood ha
 ngout\, a retro diner\, and even a non-profit community store! Guests may 
 be invited to try a local drink on this tour\, and it is appropriate for a
 ll ages. If you’re lucky\, you’ll even get a special tour of a hidden 
 passageway. This fun and informative walk will change the way you think ab
 out Cambridge. Our friendly and local guides will take guests along Massac
 husetts Avenue to uncover the evolution of the area and the ever-increasin
 g importance of self expression.\n\nSources: Meet Boston\nEvent page: http
 s://www.meetboston.com/event/central-square-cambridge-food-and-mural-arts-
 tour-(weeknight)/78895/
LOCATION:Off The Beaten Path Food Tours\, Shojo 425 Massachusetts Avenue\,
  Cambridge\, MA
URL:https://www.meetboston.com/event/central-square-cambridge-food-and-mur
 al-arts-tour-(weeknight)/78895/
