SUMMARY:Monthly Human Services drop-in in the Reference Area
DTSTART:20260303T000000
DTEND:20261201T000000
DTSTAMP:20261004T161355Z
UID:ca2b0601f367e4070b350577a4070e@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:On the first Tuesday of every month from 2:30-4 PM\, a town so
 cial worker from the Town of Falmouth Human Services will be holding an in
 formal “drop-in”. There will be a small table in the Reference Room ne
 ar the public computers (with a private meeting space available nearby).To
 wn social workers can provide information and referrals to a wide network 
