BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Daily Boston Sports Tours
DTSTART:20260412T000000
DTEND:20260412T020000
DTSTAMP:20261004T161355Z
UID:5f739d53f5241633c7c83518ae06fb@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Take one of Boston's only sports walking tours!​​ Visit ma
 jor sports sites\, monuments\, & hidden sports spots along the way! Explor
 e Our Tours Title Town Come discover why Boston gets its Title Town reputa
 tion with a walk through the Patriots\, Celtics\, and Bruins' storied hist
 ories. Learn the powerful beginnings of each team and how they rose to eli
 te prominence\, each giving Boston unforgettable record-setting title runs
 . (Duration 2hrs) TD Garden + Champions Parade Celtics + Bruins + Patriots
  West End & North End Start: Government Center End: TD Garden Click Here f
 or Title Town Tour Information/Tickets Boston Strong Come discover how Bos
 ton sports make Boston Strong! Back Bay is home to iconic sporting events 
 like the Boston Marathon and\, well\, the entire Red Sox season. Learn how
