 he strong connection between the two\, and the rich history of those who h
 ave graced these playing fields since the late 1800s. (Duration 2hrs) Mara
 thon Finish + Fenway Park Boston Marathon + Red Sox Back Bay & Kenmore Squ
 are Start: Copley Square End: Fenway Park Click Here for Boston Strong Inf
 ormation/Tickets Run 'Boston' Run your own 'Mini Boston Marathon' - warm u
 p from the Common to Kenmore and then run the last mile of the marathon ro
 ute across the finish line\, all while learning the race’s rich history 
 with a local Boston Marathoner.(Duration 1.5hrs) Boston Common + Kenmore S
 quare Last Mile of Marathon + Finish Line Back Bay & Kenmore Square Start:
  Boston Common End: Copley Square Click Here for Run 'Boston' Information/
 Tickets\n\nSources: Meet Boston\nEvent page: https://www.meetboston.com/ev
 ent/daily-boston-sports-tours/90085/
