DTSTART:20260429T000000
DTEND:20261031T000000
DTSTAMP:20261004T161355Z
UID:81925a7144fac868b1542af7f9fb66@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Our Summer shack at Boston Harbor is now open! Located at the 
 Boston Harbor Islands Welcome Center\, this shack started as a shipping co
 ntainer that was custom crafted by our team at the Luke's wood and steel f
 abrication shop to take on new life as an authentic Maine lobster shack. H
 ere we serve our signature sustainable lobster\, crab\, and shrimp rolls\,
  award-winning clam chowder\, and craft soft drinks to locals and visitors
  alike. Order at the walk up window for takeout to enjoy with covered outd
 oor seating behind the shack or for a picnic at the nearby parks. Running 
 to catch the ferry? Luke’s is a great spot for a grab-and-go lunch on yo
 ur way to explore the islands.\n\nSources: Meet Boston\nEvent page: https:
 //www.meetboston.com/event/lukes-lobster-pop-up%3a-boston-harbor-shack/903
 60/
LOCATION:Luke's Lobster\, Boston Harbor Islands\, Luke's Lobster\, Boston 
 Harbor Islands 191 Atlantic Ave.\, Boston\, MA
URL:https://www.meetboston.com/event/lukes-lobster-pop-up%3a-boston-harbor
 -shack/90360/
END:VEVENT
