BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Boston Open Market
DTSTART:20260502T000000
DTEND:20261031T000000
DTSTAMP:20261004T161355Z
UID:3a0e5768d39ab62a9f3df112680bcb@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:This vibrant open-air market features 50 local artists and sma
 ll businesses\, making it a must-visit destination for anyone who apprecia
 tes handcrafted goods and locally-made products. Conveniently located at t
 he Boylston Street entrance to the Boston Public Garden\, the market offer
 s a lush and picturesque backdrop for your shopping experience. From May t
 o October\, every Saturday is a chance to explore the diverse array of loc
 al goods\, including stunning jewelry\, fashion accessories\, pottery\, an
 d one-of-a-kind home decor. Whether you're on the hunt for a special gift 
 or simply want to treat yourself\, the Boston Open Market has something fo
 r everyone. Come join us and discover the best of Boston's local talent!\n
 \nSources: Meet Boston\nEvent page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/the-b
 oston-open-market/89971/
