 hop for the freshest seasonal produce\, locally caught seafood\, meats\, b
 aked goods\, specialty foods\, handmade goods\, and unique gifts while enj
 oying live music\, family activities\, and community connections in the he
 art of Mashpee Commons. ✨ Market Highlights: • Fresh local produce and
  farm products • Cape Cod seafood and specialty foods • Local artisans
  and makers • Live music every week • Kids' activities and family fun 
 • Community nonprofits and educational programs • SNAP/EBT accepted\, 
 plus WIC and Senior Farmers Market Nutrition Program benefits • Power of
  Produce (POP) Club for children The Mashpee Farmers Market has grown into
  one of Cape Cod's favorite weekly traditions\, welcoming thousands of vis
 itors each season while supporting local entrepreneurs\, food producers\, 
 and community organizations. Come shop local\, eat fresh\, and connect wit
 h your neighbors\; your Sunday Routine For vendor information\, schedules
 \, and updates\, visit: MashpeeFarmersMarket.com Supported by the Mashpee 
 Chamber of Commerce. Market hours and location are confirmed through Mashp
