 “Honeycomb” James comes back home famous\, changed\, and impossible to
  explain. The voice is real\, but the rumours are loud. In a town that rem
 embers everything and forgives nothing\, his return cracks open old storie
 s and new accusations. Soon no one can agree on what’s true\, only on wh
 at feels true enough to believe. Covenant is a Southern Gothic thriller ab
 out myth-making\, moral panic\, and the stories people choose when the tru
 th is too inconvenient.\n\nSources: Meet Boston\nEvent page: https://www.m
 eetboston.com/event/covenant/91447/
