 om 6pm to 8pm for an evening of brain-teasing questions\, friendly competi
 tion\, and loads of fun. Gather your friends\, family\, or colleagues and 
 put your thinking caps on as you form teams to tackle an array of diverse 
 trivia categories. Located in CanalSide Food + Drink. Come early to get an
