UID:7cd6b79d377e7839a902329257cf02@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Looking for a stress-free way to get to the Topsfield Fair? Sk
 ip the traffic\, avoid the parking chaos\, and let us handle the details w
 hile you sit back and relax. With Keolis massAdventures\, getting to the f
 air is part of the fun! Enjoy all the food\, rides\, animals\, entertainme
 nt\, and classic fair favorites without worrying about the drive. This pac
 kage will not be sold at the train station\, this MUST be booked in advanc
 e ** We are an official Partner for the Topsfield Fair*** How The Shuttle 
 Works: Choose your departure time – this is the scheduled train departur
 e from North Station. This does not mean you have to board at North Statio
 n. If another station along the line such as Lynn or Salem works for you\,
  you may board at any station. Just be sure to check the arrival time into
  your specific station. 48 hours before the event\, we’ll email you a we
 ekend commuter rail pass along with step-by-step instructions on how to ge
 t to North Station & what train to board. Our bus will be waiting for you 
 when you arrive at the Hamilton/Wenham Station the day of the trip. Return
  Details: When booking\, you’ll also select your return train time. The 
 return train times are as follows: 3:17p 5:17p 7:39p 9:39p ( only availabl
 e on Saturday\, Oct 11th) Meet the shuttle at the designated pickup spot 3
 0 minutes before your return train departs. We’ll bring you back to the 
 Wenham MBTA Station for your ride home. What's Included Commuter Rail Week
 end PassPass is valid the entire weekend of your trip on all Commuter Rail
  lines Shuttle from the Hamilton/Wenham MBTA Station to the Fair & Back at
  the end of the night Admission ticket to the Fair ($20 Value)Tickets for 
 rides are purchased separately on the grounds. $12 Food & Beverage Voucher
  BONUS GIFT! $10 off coupon for a future tour with Keolis massAdventures L
 EARN MORE / BOOK\n\nSources: Meet Boston\nEvent page: https://www.meetbost
 on.com/event/day-trip-to-topsfield-fair/92320/
LOCATION:Keolis massAdventures\, North Station\, Boston\, MA\, 02214
URL:https://www.meetboston.com/event/day-trip-to-topsfield-fair/92320/
END:VEVENT
