DESCRIPTION:For the fourth consecutive year\, City Hall Plaza will celebra
 te Latin Heritage Month in Boston. This year\, Dunamis\, Akeem’s Alchemy
  and Ágora will host “Fiesta en La Plaza presents One Night in Alosha\,
 ” an immersive celebration of the diasporic connection to Afro-Latin cul
 ture\, featuring fantasy\, Afrofuturism\, music\, theater\, and dance from
  the Afro-Latin diaspora. Join us for a free\, family-friendly celebration
  of Latin American culture. This year will feature Jorge Arce’s Raíz de
  Plena\, Manolo Mairena’s Salsa Band\, Salsa y Control\, Samba Viva\, in
 teractive installations and a live taping of the award-winning fiction pod
 cast\, “My Blood The Ink.” This event is made possible thanks to the g
 enerous support of our funders\, the Mayor’s Office of Arts and Culture 
 and Mass Cultural Council.\n\nSources: Meet Boston\nEvent page: https://ww
 w.meetboston.com/event/fiesta-en-la-plaza/93199/
