BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Felted Pumpkin Workshop with Cheryl Flett
DTSTART:20261006T000000
DTEND:20261006T000000
DTSTAMP:20261004T161355Z
UID:ea3aa488cb60dd4ab9e62fd32b6cf6@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Make Fabulous Fall Felted Pumpkins! Cheryl Flett of FabFunFibe
 r leads you through the easy to learn process of needle felting. In this h
 ands-on workshop you will practice the art of three dimensional felting as
  you create your own adorable felted pumpkins. Come with a friend\, bring 
 your tween or teen young artisan\, or just enjoy a creative evening with s
