BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Spooky Stamp Carving
DTSTART:20261007T000000
DTEND:20261007T000000
DTSTAMP:20261004T161355Z
UID:b7badcdcfbcc1d6279be2e6804bf1a@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Ages 12-18 are invited to the Roosevelt Branch to learn how to
  carve their own stamps while supplies last!\n\nSources: Discover Central 
 Massachusetts\nEvent page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/spooky-
