DESCRIPTION:This show bites. It also sucks. Join Jonathan Harker\, London
 ’s most naive real estate agent\, as he clashes with some of the most ic
 onic characters in horror literature: Van Helsing\, Renfield\, Lucy\, and 
 of course\, Count Dracula—a hunky\, self-obsessed\, pansexual\, fitness-
 nut sex icon that would put Edward Cullen to shame. You know\, exactly lik
 e Bram Stoker wrote. Described as a mash-up of Mel Brooks and Monty Python
  with just a dash of Rocky Horror \, this witty comedy will have you holdi
 ng your sides in the aisles… conveniently leaving your neck unprotected
 … LEARN MORE / GET TICKETS\n\nSources: Meet Boston\nEvent page: https://
 www.meetboston.com/event/dracula%3a-a-comedy-of-terrors/91726/
