 f handcrafts\, including fine jewelry\, ceramics\, woodwork\, sea glass de
 signs\, and handcrafted purses\, alongside seasonal items like cashmere mi
 ttens\, pashminas\, candles\, homemade jams\, paper goods\, and Christmas 
