DESCRIPTION:After five open-heart surgeries\, two LVADs\, and a heart tran
 splant\, Kyreé Miller learned that receiving a second chance at life was 
 only the beginning. On October 10\, Kyreé Miller is bringing that story t
 o the stage—with honesty\, humor\, patient advocacy\, and a real convers
 ation about what it means to reclaim your life after survival.\n\nSources:
  Meet Boston\nEvent page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/reclaiming-my-h
 eartbeat/93511/
LOCATION:The Center for Arts at the Armory\, The Center for Arts at the Ar
 mory — Rooted Café 191 Highland Ave\, Somerville\, MA
