 orena\, Abdiel Figueroa Reyes\, and Pillow Alum My’Kal Stromile. The pro
 gram marks the first-ever public presentation of work developed through Yo
 uth America Grand Prix’s groundbreaking new choreographic fellowship ini
 tiative.\n\nSources: The Berkshires\nEvent page: https://berkshires.org/ev
 ents-old/fresh-voices-in-dance/
