UID:17e8e16f4a372ec5c6c74dc4ce87ce@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:HOCKNEY REPRODUCTION(S) A Celebration of the Life and Art of D
 avid Hockney (1937–2026)‍ Manship Artists Residency Gloucester Massach
 usetts Through October 18\, 2026 Gallery Hours: Fridays\, Saturdays\, and 
 Sundays\, 1:00 – 5:00 PM Supported by The David Hockney Foundation (UK) 
 Limited Hockney Reproduction(s) is an exhibition that has been decades in 
 the making. September 9 – 11\, 2026. The Manship Barn Studio has been tr
 ansformed by an amazing collection and selection of David Hockney’s prin
 ted exhibition posters\, faxes\, books\, photographs\, and more. The show 
 is an unprecedented and unparalleled homage to the artist\, and it is the 
 final show that he approved before his passing in June. Producer and curat
 or of the show\, Bing McGilvray\, said knowingly\, “David would have lov
 ed the show. And loved the place too\, an artists residency….” In the 
 making for over a year\, the show exceeds expectations and should not be m
 issed. REGISTRATION REQUIRED: https://www.zeffy.com/en-US/ticketing/hockne
 y-reproductions-at-the-manship-artists-residency\n\nSources: North of Bost
 on\nEvent page: https://northofboston.org/event/hockney-reproductions/2026
 -10-16/
LOCATION:Manship Artists Residency\, P.O. Box 7071\, Gloucester\, MA\, 019
 30
URL:https://northofboston.org/event/hockney-reproductions/2026-10-16/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:HOCKNEY REPRODUCTION(S) A Celebration of the Life and Art of David
  Hockney (1937–2026)‍
DTSTART:20261016T130000
DTEND:20261016T170000
DTSTAMP:20261004T161355Z
UID:4e4963b72bfb45c6c7207aeeba5a17@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Hockney Reproduction(s) is an exhibition that has been decades
  in the making. The Manship Barn Studio has been transformed by an amazing
  collection and selection of David Hockney’s printed exhibition posters
 \, faxes\, books\, photographs\, and more. The show is an unprecedented an
 d unparalleled homage to the artist\, and it is the final show that he app
 roved before his passing in June. Producer and curator of the show\, Bing 
 McGilvray\, said knowingly\, “David would have loved the show. And loved
  the place too\, an artists residency….” In the making for over a year
 \, the show exceeds expectations and should not be missed. REGISTRATION RE
 QUIRED.\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEvent page: https://northofboston.org
 /event/hockney-reproductions-a-celebration-of-the-life-and-art-of-david-ho
 ckney-1937-2026/2026-10-16/
LOCATION:Manship Artists Residency\, P.O. Box 7071\, Gloucester\, MA\, 019
 30
URL:https://northofboston.org/event/hockney-reproductions-a-celebration-of
 -the-life-and-art-of-david-hockney-1937-2026/2026-10-16/
END:VEVENT
