DESCRIPTION:Join us at the Woods Hole Library to collage and draw to creat
 e an innovative\, treasured art piece. Mixed-media art teacher Sarah Kahn 
 will guide you and your child through the steps to complete a fun and mean
 ingful piece. All ages are welcome - this workshop is designed for both ki
 ds and caregivers. Materials will be provided and feel free to bring paper
 s and pages from date books\, maps or journals\, to imbue your artwork wit
 h personal meaning. No registration required.\n\nSources: Cape Cod Chamber
