DTEND:20261025T000000
DTSTAMP:20261004T161355Z
UID:3591b43015a80f7e04fe760f14712c@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Join Culinary Director Kate Rickard for a delicious and techni
 que rich pie class celebrating two standout favorites of the season. In th
 is demonstration style workshop\, you’ll explore the fundamentals of gre
 at pie baking while learning how to craft Dutch Apple Pie\, Maple Pecan Ta
 rt\, Pate Brisee\, Pate Sucre. This class blends approachable instruction 
 with professional technique\, giving you the confidence to recreate each p
 ie at home. Register online today or call 508-495-1878 ext. 2.\n\nSources:
  Cape Cod Chamber\nEvent page: https://www.capecodchamber.org/event/profes
 sional-pie-baking-with-kate-rickard/52550/
LOCATION:Highfield Hall & Gardens\, 56 Highfield Drive\, Falmouth\, MA\, 0
 2540
URL:https://www.capecodchamber.org/event/professional-pie-baking-with-kate
 -rickard/52550/
END:VEVENT
