DTEND:20261026T170000
DTSTAMP:20261004T161355Z
UID:d987dd81edf2ce7908fec8dd090c27@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Beverly Mitchell Art Exhibit at the GAR Memorial Library\, Wes
 t Newbury MA On Display Oct. 2-30\, 2026 during regular library hours Mond
 ay – Wednesday 10:00 AM — 7:00 PM Thursday – Friday 10:00 AM — 5:0
 0 PM Saturday 9:00 AM — 1:00 PM Opening Reception Oct. 2 from 3-5 pm Bev
 erly Mitchell is a graduate of the Montserrat College of Art in Beverly\, 
 MA. A longtime resident of West Newbury\, she has taught art classes at he
 r home studio at 4 Maple Street in West Newbury from 1990-2019\, starting 
 back up in 2022 post-Covid. She is still taking on art students of all age
 s. Beverly’s colorful art has been exhibited widely throughout the regio
 n. If you are interested in purchasing her art or in taking art classes\, 
 please call her at 978-363-2729.\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEvent page: 
