DESCRIPTION:Oh what fun it is to make…an outdoor decoration that lasts f
 or weeks!! In this workshop you will learn the technique to make and decor
 ate an evergreen ball that looks wonderful hung on a porch\, hanging from 
 a shepherd’s hook in your yard\, or even hanging in your house. This is 
 a great way to spend an afternoon with a friend and get in the holiday spi
 rit. You don’t want to miss this class!\n\nSources: The Berkshires\nEven
 t page: https://berkshires.org/events-old/kissing-ball-the-original-mistle
 toe/
