BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Clements Brothers Present A Paul Simon Tribute
DTSTART:20261127T193000
DTEND:20261127T213000
DTSTAMP:20261004T161355Z
UID:ffe06edffde4991289044f3fdd188b@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Experience the timeless music of Paul Simon with The Clements 
 Brothers in a captivating quartet tribute filled with soaring harmonies an
 d exceptional musicianship. George Clements brings the music vividly to li
 fe\, drawing on his experience portraying Paul Simon in the national tour 
 of The Simon & Garfunkel Story. The Clements Brothers are George and Charl
 es Clements\, identical twins from New England. They’ve been playing and
  writing music together for as long as they can remember and ‘The Clemen
 ts Brothers’ marks their first project together since playing in the int
 ernationally touring grass-roots band\, ‘The Lonely Heartstring Band’ 
 with whom they put out two albums on Rounder Records. With roots\, rock\, 
 bluegrass\, jazz\, and classical influences\, George (on guitar) and Charl
 es (on bass) aim to capture their singer-songwriter sensibilities in a uni
 que blended voice\, at once enthralling and intimate\, groovy and serene. 
 Their first album ‘Dandelion Breeze’ was released in 2023 on Plow Man 
 Records and their sophomore record is set to be released in the Fall of 20
 26. The duo is a fusion of each brother’s unique musical journey\, and t
 he result is music all its own\, filled with vocal harmonies\, instrumenta
 l virtuosity\, and a genuine love of song.\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEv
 ent page: https://northofboston.org/event/the-clements-brothers-present-a-
 paul-simon-tribute/
LOCATION:Shalin Liu Performance Center\, 37 Main Street\, Rockport\, MA\, 
 01966
URL:https://northofboston.org/event/the-clements-brothers-present-a-paul-s
 imon-tribute/
END:VEVENT
