DTEND:20261212T170000
DTSTAMP:20261004T161355Z
UID:4b4bf4963e714a8eda11f2df0dee3e@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the second Saturday of each month\, when the Cape 
 Ann Museum is free for all Cape Ann residents. Visitors of all ages are in
 vited to visit the CAM Education Studio to enjoy a new hands-on art projec
